# Izadi Counselling

SwiftUI iOS app at `ios/Izadi/`. Firebase Auth + Firestore. Bundle ID `com.turtletech.izadicounselling`.

## Do

- Match existing Izadi UI (sage/foam/butter, Outfit fonts, SoftScreenBackground).
- Keep HomeView mounted behind Face ID; overlay only.
- Courtesy SMS: local notifications from T-2 9am–5pm every 2h; include exact 3h-before ping; stop after Mark as complete or cutoff. Wrap-up highlight wins over courtesy SMS.
- Bump `CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION` only when uploading to TestFlight, never on every small change. Version stays 1.1 until a new user-facing release. Next upload after 1.1 (6) is build 7+.
- Info.plist version/build must stay `$(MARKETING_VERSION)` and `$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)`.

## Don’t

- Don’t auto-send SMS; always open Messages with a prefilled body.
- Don’t reset build numbers downward (App Store Connect rejects).
- Don’t treat `GoogleService-Info.plist` as commitable real secrets from this cloud copy; the Mac has the real file.
- Don’t unmount HomeView to lock the app.
- Don’t add a home “what’s next” task list unless asked (that work was reverted).
